    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107699" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερμήκης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερμετρ-μάκης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ</span>] <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>O.</u>
			7.37
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆκος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exceedingly long,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					591
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ βασιλέος . . χεὶρ ὑ.</span>
			the king's arm is <i>very long,</i> reaches <i>very far,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.140
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>exceedingly high,</i> of mountains, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.128
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερμάκης βοά</span> a cry <i>exceeding
				loud,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i> l. c.</div>
